So in particular we can substitute $\nar R := (\lambda \nar b . \nar b \equiv \nar a  )$ and $\nar a' = \mathsf{refl}$ to get

\[\nar \Gamma \nprov  \bunglue((\epair {q} {q'})\ (\gg(x: \nar A).x \equiv \nar a)\ (\bglue(\nar a, \mathsf{refl}))) : q\ \nar A\ \nar a \equiv \nar a\]

